OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, which may be heavy.
OL,8,
OL,9,CTonight:FAny remaining showers will
OL,10,Fclear this evening, leaving it dry
OL,11,Fwith clear spells. Cloud will increase
OL,12,Fagain overnight, bringing a few
OL,13,Ffurther light showers later.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSaturday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,16,Fwith sunny spells, although a few
OL,17,Flight showers are possible, mainly
OL,18,Fduring the morning. Winds will be
OL,19,Fgentle to moderate.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
